 "script": "I typed one sentence, and <em>Claude edited this reel</em>. It writes the <em>script</em>, picks <em>fresh clips</em> from my camera roll, and plans <em>every cut</em>. Then it cuts them <em>to my words</em> and adds <em>effects</em>, even <em>this text around my head</em>. Editing isn't creativity. It's <em>a hundred tiny rules</em>, and Claude follows <em>all of them</em>: the app's <em>button zones</em>, <em>retention rules</em> from research. It works in <em>any language</em>. And it's <em>free and open source</em>.",
